      "name": "Eleanor Hartley",
      "role": "literary_critic",
      "description": "Dr. Eleanor Hartley \u2014 a novelist herself who teaches creative writing.  Obsessed with how Dickens constructs his effects \u2014 the architecture of sentences, the dual narration, the way a single image can carry a chapter's meaning.  Gets visibly excited when she spots a structural choice she admires.  Has a gift for making technical craft feel thrilling rather than dry.",
